It should format short block arguments
{%block "hero",heading:heading,content:captured_content%}{%endblock%}

It should wrap block arguments
printWidth: 1
{% block "featured-heading", heading: section.settings.heading, alignment: section.settings.alignment %}
Heading
{% endblock %}

It should indent inline body content
{%block "hero",heading:heading%}<h2>{{heading}}</h2>{%endblock%}
